<title>GERMANY: German Riedel de Haen suspended from trade.</title>
<headline>German Riedel de Haen suspended from trade.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Frankfurt bourse said on Friday it had suspended shares in German chemicals firm Riedel de Haen from dealings.</p>
<p>The stock closed at 2,160 marks on Thursday.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
